 9.1.0 - 2022-08-27
 ------------------
 
+* Fixed formatting of nested character ranges and ranges of temporary views
+  that only provide non-const iteration, including C++20 split/transform views.
+
 * ``fmt::formatted_size`` now works at compile time
   (`#3026 <https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt/pull/3026>`_). For example
   (`godbolt <https://godbolt.org/z/1MW5rMdf8>`__):
